see "../src/rng.vox".
see "../src/gen_literals.vox".
see "../src/gen_core.vox".
see "../src/gen_buffers.vox".
see "../src/gen_files.vox".
see "../src/gen_collections.vox".
see "../src/gen_text.vox".
see "../src/gen_things.vox".
see "../src/gen_flow.vox".
see "../src/gen_misc.vox".

(The ledger's environment leaves, batch A - docs/ledger/environment.md
 rows ENV-02, ENV-03, ENV-04, ENV-05, ENV-06, ENV-10, ENV-11.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself - the
 same shape as tests/300_gen_buffers_a.vox, and for the same reason:
 these leaves exist to emit assertions, and an assertion whose text
 drifts is an assertion nobody is reading.

 Each leaf is emitted at the true top level (nested false) and, for the
 closer-safe ones, inside a block (nested true) - the two renderings of
 'gen join lines'. The entry scan is top level only and is emitted once.
 The name allocator is exercised on its own at the end: thirty words,
 never twice in one program, a suffix only once they run out.)

Set gen_flags to 1.

Print "--- ENV-02, ENV-05: count and empty agree ---".
'rng seed' of 11.
'gen environment names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment agreement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment agreement' of "    " and true.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- ENV-06 (ENV-03, ENV-04): a lookup read several ways agrees with itself ---".
'rng seed' of 23.
'gen environment names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment lookup' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment lookup' of "    " and true.
Print 'gen text'.
'rng seed' of 24.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment lookup' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- ENV-10, ENV-11: the exists predicate ---".
'rng seed' of 37.
'gen environment names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment exists' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment exists' of "    " and true.
Print 'gen text'.
'rng seed' of 38.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment exists' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- ENV-03, ENV-04: an entry contains an equals sign ---".
'rng seed' of 41.
'gen environment names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment entry scan' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the dispatchers ---".
'rng seed' of 53.
'gen environment names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf environment with a loop or handler' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- names: thirty words, no repeats, then a suffix ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen environment names reset'.
a number called 'names drawn' is 0.
While 'names drawn' is less than 32,
    a text called 'the stem' is 'gen environment name',
    Print 'gen buffer reference' of 'the stem',
    Set 'names drawn' to 'names drawn' add 1.
